      "content": "Thanks. You mentioned the bitumen viscosity and the thermal stress—can you go a bit deeper into the subgrade compaction aspect? If the subgrade isn't compacted properly, how exactly does that accelerate the longitudinal cracking when the temperature shifts? I'm trying to figure out if we're looking at a material issue or a preparation issue.",
